OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,8,Foverturn Labour's ban on all new oil
OL,9,Fand gas licences, following the
OL,10,Fdecision to allow drilling at Jackdaw
OL,11,Fgas field
OL,13,FDuring PMQs, the Tory leader accused
OL,14,Fthe government of "dithering" over the
OL,15,Fdecision - but Burnham said ministers
OL,16,Fmade a call the Tories previously
OL,17,F"messed up"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
