OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was announced earlier that
OL,8,Fextraction from Jackdaw, in the North
OL,9,FSea, had been approved, with the
OL,10,Fgovernment saying it would help "heat
OL,11,Fmillions of homes" and protect
OL,12,F"hundreds of jobs"
OL,14,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh
OL,15,Ftells the BBC the gas from Jackdaw
OL,16,F"won't lower energy bills this winter"
OL,17,F- our business editor says the new
OL,18,Ffield will contribute less than 3% of
OL,19,Fthe UK's gas needs
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
