OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FEnvironmentalists argue more drilling
OL,8,Fwill hamper efforts to cut
OL,9,Fplanet-warming carbon emissions
OL,11,FJackdaw was approved by the
OL,12,FConservatives in 2022, but was delayed
OL,13,Fby legal challenges - here's a brief
OL,14,Fhistory and here's a reminder of UK and
OL,15,FScottish net zero targets
